aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(-\\frac{2}{3})\\cdot 6+(-2)\\cdot (-6) & (-\\frac{2}{3})\\cdot 6+(-2)\\cdot (-4) \\\\ 2\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-6) & 2\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-4)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4+12 & -4+8 \\\\ 12+(-6) & 12+(-4)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127288/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5dbfd5f3-553b-5276-8716-bbceddefc4d3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127288"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275391/field-1/85f23a53be0e95a7e191561cc5a77501369717526aae5254cc8d13ed8080d997" :answer/id #uuid "3edd0d3e-3210-5988-a694-e6590e139c5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "52" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275391/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e075209-34ae-5a8c-ac39-855b286510a2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275391/field-1/85f23a53be0e95a7e191561cc5a77501369717526aae5254cc8d13ed8080d997" :answer-field/choices ["q-275391/field-1/85f23a53be0e95a7e191561cc5a77501369717526aae5254cc8d13ed8080d997"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275391" :question/id #uuid "4845bddd-ca09-5d33-95e4-cd751a4dab4a" :question/math-academy-id "q-275391" :question/problem "Let $F=GH.$ What is the value of ${f}_{12}$, if\n\n$$\nG=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}],\\,H=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -5 \\\\ 2 & 7\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${f}_{12}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying the $1$st row in $G$ by the $2$nd column in $H$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{12} & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot (-5)+6\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =10+42 \\\\  & =52.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275391/field-1"] :db/ensure [:q