igned}3 & -6 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${f}_{21}=$ \n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $G$ by the $1$st column in $H$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{21} & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =5\\cdot 3+(-2)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-318317/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a827b0d0-faa2-521f-b166-e13873b1da00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-318317"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70198/selection/986d50161abd0ff59fc29e7f766ab19bd1aabbf561d9151bef98f79ba0ebf550" :answer/id #uuid "81308a9b-d2c2-59bf-84bf-35d9ce88ac43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-49" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70198/selection/30d87289ce9cf4ee21b8a2dd0c77a8f827960a63af81df54e0fe73dfc1b823fc" :answer/id #uuid "926819fc-3003-5ccf-9d3b-8d62165f681f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "47" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70198/selection/59cabed12271767d3647412725d382bc72464274dc4ac46b4e7903c969156a02" :answer/id #uuid "6b11ec01-0a60-5905-a78a-9c038c08f1af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "19" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70198/selection/b556bb502f914dc4fab0f40312f13f23b29e033ef49212306202180f04718e6f" :answer/id #uuid "c3a1181e-3b37-5b97-9f9a-d9f7c5e22f61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-22" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70198/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "76894d3a-0fcb-59e8-8d2e-3b32a86fc58a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70198/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dfe58f4c-69fc-526f-8f97-a9a0ad18582c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70198/selection/30